  q(DIS,'Terbinafine is used for fungal nail infections. What should patients know?','Treatment often lasts 6 to 12 weeks, and liver tests may be needed',['It cures nail fungus in one day and never needs to be repeated or followed up','It is applied only to the scalp','It is an antibiotic for strep throat'],'D','Nails grow slowly, so it can take months for a healthy nail to replace the infected one.',STU),
  q(DIS,'How is nystatin oral suspension used for thrush?','Swish in the mouth and then swallow',['Inject it into the gums','Apply it to the eyes','Inhale it through a spacer'],'A','Keeping the liquid in the mouth for a while lets it work on the yeast directly.',STU),
  q(DIS,'Medroxyprogesterone acetate injection prevents pregnancy for how long per dose?','About 3 months',['About 1 day','About 5 years','About 1 week'],'B','Long-term use can lower bone density, so calcium and vitamin D intake matter.',STU)
